25,175.22,180.1,1735200],[181.17,181.83,178.15,178.43,1639400]],"about":{"what":"Digital Realty (DLR). This chart runs from Sep 10, 2024 to Jan 17, 2025.","setup":"The stock rose about 36% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 4 weeks, peaking at $193.88 and pulling back 12% at its deepest. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Nov 26, 2024 it closed at $194.02, its first close above the base high of $192.62. Volume that day was 2.0M shares, 0.84x the prior 10-day average of 2.3M. It didn't hold. By Dec 4, 2024 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $178.43.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}